# Salvation Engine: "Other artifact creatures you control get +2/+2" and "return up to one target artifact card from your
# graveyard" are both its controller's (CR 109.5, 115.1). Bot1 and Bot2 each sacrifice a Lotus Petal for mana, so an
# artifact card lies in each graveyard, and Bot2 casts an Ornithopter. When the Engine attacks on turn 3 (crewed by Adaptive
# Snapjaw, CR 702.122a) its trigger cannot target Bot2's Lotus Petal and returns Bot1's (CR 400.3). Bot2's Ornithopter, an
# artifact creature Bot1 does not control, stays a 0/2.

